        {
          "title": "Tap the area",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Draw the area first with <strong>Markers</strong> on <strong>Unknown</strong> or <strong>Enemy</strong>, then <strong>Area</strong>. In <strong>Drones</strong>, tap <strong>Ask for a drone</strong>, then the area's outline.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a98247db02e33873.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Recon is chosen",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On an area, <strong>Recon</strong> is already chosen. Under <strong>To</strong>, pick who to ask.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a26009033e95b1bb.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Ask every team",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Any</strong> to ask every team, then <strong>Send</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4038c562bb417d57.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See it waiting",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Drones</strong>. <strong>My requests</strong> shows it as <strong>Waiting for a team</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2268a7bc3636ad9a.webp",
